Smart Family Tree & Relationship Intelligence Platform

Act as a senior product designer, full-stack software engineer, database architect, and UX specialist. Build a complete, modern, responsive web application called KinRoots — a smart family tree and family relationship platform that makes it effortless for people to build their family tree, understand relationships between any two people, collaborate with relatives, and preserve family memories.

